    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "BLUF",
      "narration_text": "People treat temperature like a creativity dial that makes the model smarter. It changes the odds, not the knowledge. The model's scores stay the same. Temperature only decides how boldly it gambles on them.",
