      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "FRAMEWORK",
      "narration_text": "Picture the model finishing: the cat sat on the. It gives every candidate word a score. Here, mat three, sofa two, roof one point two, moon point two. Temperature divides those scores. Then they're turned into odds that add up to one, and the model rolls the dice. Temperature touches exactly one step.",
