      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "MECHANISM",
      "narration_text": "Now temperature two. Same scores, but dividing by two squeezes the gaps. Mat falls to forty-four percent, and moon climbs to eleven. One sentence in nine, the cat sits on the moon. Notice what didn't change: the order. Mat is still first. The model knows exactly what it knew before. It's just gambling more.",
